<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-badge">PERSONAL NUTRITION</view>
    <view class="hero-title">算清身体数据，<text>吃得更明白</text></view>
    <view class="hero-copy">输入基础信息，生成你的体重方向、每日热量和饮食结构。</view>
    <view class="hero-orbit orbit-one"></view>
    <view class="hero-orbit orbit-two"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card form-card">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <view>
        <view class="eyebrow">STEP 01</view>
        <view class="section-title">填写身体信息</view>
      </view>
      <view class="reset-link" bindtap="reset">清空</view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-grid">
      <view class="field half">
        <view class="field-label">性别</view>
        <picker range="{{sexOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{sexIndex}}" bindchange="onSexChange">
          <view class="picker-value">
            <text>{{sexOptions[sexIndex].label}}</text>
            <text class="chevron">⌄</text>
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>

      <view class="field half">
        <view class="field-label">年龄</view>
        <view class="input-wrap">
          <input type="number" value="{{form.age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="onFieldInput" placeholder="18～80" />
          <text class="unit">岁</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field half">
        <view class="field-label">身高</view>
        <view class="input-wrap">
          <input type="digit" value="{{form.heightCm}}" data-field="heightCm" bindinput="onFieldInput" placeholder="例如 180" />
          <text class="unit">cm</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field half">
        <view class="field-row">
          <view class="field-label">体重</view>
          <view class="unit-switch">
            <text class="{{weightUnit === 'jin' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-unit="jin" bindtap="setWeightUnit">斤</text>
            <text class="{{weightUnit === 'kg' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-unit="kg" bindtap="setWeightUnit">kg</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="input-wrap">
          <input type="digit" value="{{form.weight}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="onFieldInput" placeholder="例如 180" />
          <text class="unit">{{weightUnit === 'jin' ? '斤' : 'kg'}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field activity-field">
      <view class="field-label">日常活动量</view>
      <picker range="{{activityOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{activityIndex}}" bindchange="onActivityChange">
        <view class="activity-picker">
          <view>
            <view class="activity-name">{{activityOptions[activityIndex].label}}</view>
            <view class="activity-detail">{{activityOptions[activityIndex].detail}}</view>
          </view>
          <text class="chevron">⌄</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="calculate">生成我的饮食方案</button>
    <view class="privacy-tip">数据仅保存在你的设备本地，不会上传</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{result}}" id="result" class="result-area">
    <view class="section-heading result-heading">
      <view>
        <view class="eyebrow">STEP 02</view>
        <view class="section-title">你的分析结果</view>
      </view>
      <view class="goal-pill">{{result.goal.label}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="metric-grid">
      <view class="metric-card featured">
        <view class="metric-label">BMI</view>
        <view class="metric-value">{{result.bmi}}</view>
        <view class="metric-status" style="color: {{result.bmiLevel.color}}">{{result.bmiLevel.label}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-card">
        <view class="metric-label">估算体脂率</view>
        <view class="metric-value">{{result.bodyFat}}<text>%</text></view>
        <view class="metric-caption">{{result.bodyFatLabel}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-card">
        <view class="metric-label">健康体重范围</view>
        <view class="metric-range">{{result.normalWeightRange}}</view>
        <view class="metric-caption">按 BMI 18.5～23.9</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card goal-card">
      <view class="goal-mark">目标</view>
      <view class="goal-content">
        <view class="goal-title">{{result.goal.label}}</view>
        <view class="goal-summary">{{result.goal.summary}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card calorie-card">
      <view class="card-title-row">
        <view>
          <view class="eyebrow">DAILY TARGET</view>
          <view class="section-title small">每日营养目标</view>
        </view>
        <view class="calorie-total"><text>{{result.targetCalories}}</text> kcal</view>
      </view>

      <view class="calorie-meta">
        <view><text>基础代谢</text><text class="strong-text">{{result.bmr}} kcal</text></view>
        <view><text>维持热量</text><text class="strong-text">{{result.tdee}} kcal</text></view>
      </view>

      <view class="macro-list">
        <view class="macro-item protein">
          <view class="macro-top"><text>蛋白质</text><text class="strong-text">{{result.macros.protein}} g</text></view>
          <view class="macro-track"><view style="width: 72%"></view></view>
        </view>
        <view class="macro-item carbs">
          <view class="macro-top"><text>碳水化合物</text><text class="strong-text">{{result.macros.carbs}} g</text></view>
          <view class="macro-track"><view style="width: 86%"></view></view>
        </view>
        <view class="macro-item fat">
          <view class="macro-top"><text>脂肪</text><text class="strong-text">{{result.macros.fat}} g</text></view>
          <view class="macro-track"><view style="width: 54%"></view></view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="quick-targets">
        <view><text class="quick-icon">💧</text><text>饮水 {{result.water}} L</text></view>
        <view><text class="quick-icon">🥬</text><text>蔬菜 {{result.vegetable}}</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card meal-card">
      <view class="eyebrow">MEAL STRUCTURE</view>
      <view class="section-title small">一日参考食谱 · 按克称量</view>
      <view class="weight-guide">每项都标注称重状态。生重＝烹调前；熟重＝烹调后；可食部＝去掉骨、壳、核等不吃的部分。营养数值为估算，请优先参考包装标签。</view>
      <view class="field-label">食谱中的鸡胸肉怎样称？</view>
      <view class="weight-tabs">
        <button class="{{chickenMode === 'raw' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="raw" bindtap="setChickenMode">生重备餐</button>
        <button class="{{chickenMode === 'cooked' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="cooked" bindtap="setChickenMode">熟重称量（烤熟）</button>
      </view>
      <view class="weight-guide">切换会按不同营养条目重新配餐，不能将前后的克数视为同一份肉的精确生熟换算。米饭仍按熟重、蔬菜仍按生重计算。</view>
      <view class="meal-list">
        <view class="meal-row" wx:for="{{result.meals}}" wx:key="name">
          <view class="meal-time">
            <view class="meal-name">{{item.name}}</view>
            <view class="meal-percent">食物合计</view>
          </view>
          <view class="meal-body">
            <view class="meal-nutrients">
              <text class="strong-text">约 {{item.calories}} kcal</text>
              <text>蛋白 {{item.protein}}g · 碳水 {{item.carbs}}g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}}g</text>
            </view>
            <view class="food-row" wx:for="{{item.foods}}" wx:for-item="food" wx:key="id">
              <view class="food-title">{{food.name}} <text class="food-grams">{{food.grams}} g</text></view>
              <view class="weight-badge">{{food.state}}</view>
              <view class="food-note">{{food.note}}</view>
              <view class="food-nutrients">约 {{food.calories}} kcal · 蛋白 {{food.protein}} g</view>
              <view class="food-nutrients">碳水 {{food.carbs}} g · 脂肪 {{food.fat}} g</view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="plan-total">
        <view class="section-title small">全天食谱与目标对照</view>
        <view class="compare-row table-head"><text>营养</text><text>目标</text><text>食谱估算</text><text>差额</text></view>
        <view class="compare-row" wx:for="{{result.foodPlan.differences}}" wx:key="key">
          <text>{{item.label}}<text class="table-unit">{{item.unit}}</text></text><text>{{item.target}}</text><text>{{item.actual}}</text><text>{{item.delta}}</text>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{result.foodPlan.needsAdjustment}}" class="plan-warning">部分营养与目标相差超过 10%，此食谱尚未达标，需要调整食物组合或份量。</view>
        <view class="weight-guide">这是可称量的单日配餐示例，未考虑个人过敏、乳糖不耐受及口味偏好。不能随意等克替换食物；加酱料、裹粉或额外用油需另计。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card tips-card">
      <view class="eyebrow">ACTION PLAN</view>
      <view class="section-title small">执行建议</view>
      <view class="tip-row" wx:for="{{result.tips}}" wx:key="*this">
        <view class="tip-index">{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="tip-text">{{item}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="method-card">
      <view class="method-head" bindtap="toggleMethod">
        <text>计算依据与使用说明</text>
        <text>{{showMethod ? '收起' : '查看'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{showMethod}}" class="method-body">
        <text>BMI 用于判断体重区间；体脂率采用成人公式估算，会受肌肉量、年龄等因素影响。每日热量基于 Mifflin-St Jeor 基础代谢公式和活动系数计算。</text>
        <text>本结果仅用于健康管理参考，不用于疾病诊断。孕期、哺乳期、未成年人、有慢性病或进食障碍史的人群，请咨询医生或注册营养师。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card chicken-card">
    <view class="eyebrow">RAW &amp; COOKED</view>
    <view class="section-title small">鸡胸肉蛋白质速查</view>
    <view class="weight-guide">每 100 g 可食部参考。两行分别称取，不代表同一块肉做熟前后。</view>
    <view class="reference-pair">
      <view><text class="weight-badge">生重 · 去皮去骨</text><view class="reference-value">22.5 <text>g 蛋白质</text></view><view class="food-note">120 kcal / 100 g</view></view>
      <view><text class="weight-badge">熟重 · 烤熟纯肉</text><view class="reference-value">31 <text>g 蛋白质</text></view><view class="food-note">165 kcal / 100 g</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="weight-guide">熟肉每 100 g 的蛋白质通常更集中，主要因为烹调失水，并不是凭空增加蛋白质。烹调也可能造成营养流失；水煮、煎烤、油炸和腌制品不能套用同一个熟重数值。</view>
    <view class="field-label">输入鸡胸肉重量，分别查看生重 / 熟重结果</view>
    <view class="input-wrap"><input type="digit" value="{{chickenGrams}}" bindinput="onChickenInput" placeholder="例如 150" aria-label="鸡胸肉重量（克）" /><text class="unit">g</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{chickenError}}" class="plan-warning">{{chickenError}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{chickenResult}}" class="calculator-results">
      <view>若为 {{chickenGrams}} g 生重：约 <text class="food-grams">{{chickenResult.raw.protein}} g 蛋白质</text>，{{chickenResult.raw.calories}} kcal</view>
      <view>若为 {{chickenGrams}} g 熟重（烤熟）：约 <text class="food-grams">{{chickenResult.cooked.protein}} g 蛋白质</text>，{{chickenResult.cooked.calories}} kcal</view>
    </view>
    <view class="weight-guide">计算方式：食物克数 ÷ 100 × 对应状态的每 100 g 营养值。若要知道同一批肉的生熟重量关系，请分别称量烹调前后总重；本工具不使用固定缩水比例。</view>
    <view class="source-actions"><button size="mini" data-id="chickenRaw" bindtap="copyFoodSource">复制生重来源</button><button size="mini" data-id="chickenCooked" bindtap="copyFoodSource">复制熟重来源</button></view>
    <view class="food-note">USDA SR Legacy：171077 / 171477。数值为近似参考，生重鸡肉需做熟后食用。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="method-card">
    <view class="method-head" bindtap="toggleFoods"><text>食物营养参考表 · 每 100 g</text><text>{{showFoods ? '收起' : '展开'}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{showFoods}}" class="food-reference-list">
      <view wx:for="{{foodReferences}}" wx:key="id" class="food-row">
        <view class="food-title">{{item.name}} <text class="weight-badge">{{item.state}}</text></view>
        <view class="food-nutrients">{{item.calories}} kcal · 蛋白 {{item.protein}} g · 碳水 {{item.carbs}} g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}} g</view>
        <view class="food-note">{{item.note}}</view>
        <button size="mini" class="source-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="copyFoodSource">复制数据来源</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
